---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19255550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(925) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pilot Light Won't Stay Lit Concord CA | Gas Water Heater Repair" description="Gas water heater pilot light won't stay lit in Concord, CA? Thermocouple and pilot assembly repair. Fast, affordable same-day service.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Pilot Light Issues</div>
      <h1>Pilot Light Won't Stay Lit</h1>
      <p>A pilot that lights then goes out is one of the most common gas water heater calls — and one of the fastest to fix when the thermocouple is the culprit.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Fix It Today — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why the Pilot Goes Out</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Failed thermocouple</strong> — The safety device that senses the pilot flame. Most common cause.</li>
        <li>Dirty pilot orifice or burner</li>
        <li>Draft or venting issues blowing out the pilot</li>
        <li>Failing gas control valve</li>
        <li>Low gas pressure</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We clean the pilot assembly, test and replace the thermocouple when needed, and verify stable operation before we leave. Most of these repairs are completed in a single short visit.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Pilot Repair</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
